Keep a shared symbol as 0.

To expand from rows (a whole number) with place (a whole number).
If rows is 1, set symbol to 0, return.
If place modulo 2 is 1, expand from rows minus 1 with (place plus 1) divided by 2.
If place modulo 2 is 0, expand from rows minus 1 with place divided by 2, set symbol to 1 minus symbol.

Expand from 4 with 5.
Show symbol.
